      "source_id": "unreconciled:step-q211991",
      "problem": "Given that $a≡b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,9),$ construct a statement that also must be true:\n\n$$\na-{{field-1}}≡b-{{field-2}}\\,(\\text{mod}\\,9)\n$$",
